		'body'        => array(
			'A premium domain is a name worth far more than its registration fee: short, easy to spell, built on a common word, or a strong .com. <strong>Premium domain acquisition</strong> means buying one of these names, either from a marketplace listing or directly from an owner who has not offered it for sale.',
